  "description": "Grafana is an open source, feature rich metrics dashboard and graph editor for Graphite, InfluxDB \u0026 OpenTSDB.   \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * grafana: Azure Monitor data source could leak its Azure access token (CVE-2026-88967)\n  * github.com/klauspost/compress/zstd: klauspost/compress: Denial of Service via crafted zstd compressed input (CVE-2026-116591)\n  * grafana: Grafana: Information disclosure via legacy schema switch in contact points (CVE-2026-100105)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
